{
  "esm": "1.1.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "pde_inline_reference_dimension_names",
    "description": "Conformance fixture for esm-spec 6.6.5: an inline `reference` whose free variables are the field's DIMENSION NAMES. `u` is shaped over the interval index set `x` (size 8) and decays as du/dt = -u from u(0) = cos(pi (x - 1/2)/8), so u(t) = exp(-t) cos(pi (x - 1/2)/8) exactly at the cell positions x = 1..8 (index space, convention 1 of 6.6.5). The assertions spell the reference in the four ways the section admits and pin that they agree: (1) the analytic form with the dimension name FREE, `cos(pi (x - 1/2)/8)`, at t = 0 (L2 error 0 to round-off); (2) the same free-name form times exp(-1) at t = 1; (3) a lookup form `index(const[1,4,...,64], x)` reading a per-cell table by the dimension name, whose Linf distance from u(1) is a definite number; (4) the pre-existing explicit-gather spelling `faq(i from x; cos(pi (i - 1/2)/8))`, which mentions no dimension name and must evaluate exactly as before; and (5) a faq that binds the dimension name as ITS OWN loop symbol, `faq(x from x; cos(pi (x - 1/2)/8))`, which must not be wrapped a second time. (6) is a `mean` with no reference, the regression guard that a reference-free reduction is untouched. A binding that leaves the dimension name unbound fails (1)-(3) with an unbound-name error; one that wraps blindly fails (5).",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "conformance",
      "pde-inline-test",
      "esm-spec-6.6.5",
      "reference",
      "dimension-names"
    ]
  },
  "index_sets": {
    "x": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": 8
    }
  },
  "models": {
    "M": {
      "variables": {
        "u": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "x"
          ],
          "description": "Decaying field over x; u(t) = exp(-t) cos(pi (x - 1/2)/8) at cell x."
        }
      },
      "equations": [
        {
          "lhs": {
            "op": "ic",
            "args": [
              "u"
            ]
          },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "args": [],
            "output_idx": [
              "i"
            ],
            "ranges": {
              "i": {
                "from": "x"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "cos",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "*",
                  "args": [
                    3.141592653589793,
                    {
                      "op": "/",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "-",
                          "args": [
                            "i",
                            0.5
                          ]
                        },
                        8
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "args": [],
            "output_idx": [
              "i"
            ],
            "ranges": {
              "i": [
                1,
                8
              ]
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "D",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "u",
                    "i"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "wrt": "t"
            }
          },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "args": [],
            "output_idx": [
              "i"
            ],
            "ranges": {
              "i": [
                1,
                8
              ]
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
                -1,
                {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "u",
                    "i"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "reference_dimension_names",
          "description": "u(t) = exp(-t) cos(pi (x - 1/2)/8) exactly; the reference is spelled with the free dimension name x (1, 2), as a table lookup by x (3), as the explicit gather (4), and with x rebound as the faq's own loop symbol (5); (6) has no reference. Assertions 1 and 2 both sample t=0 and differ only in the reference's SCALE: 1 asserts the exact field (relative L2 error 0), 2 asserts it against the same shape scaled by exp(-1), whose relative L2 error is therefore e-1 exactly, independent of the field. Neither carries the time-integrator's residual, which is what lets this category hold its sibling categories' 1e-11 comparison atol.",
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 1.0
          },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "u",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "tolerance": {
                "rel": 0.0,
                "abs": 1e-12
              },
              "reduce": "L2_error",
              "reference": {
                "op": "cos",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      3.141592653589793,
                      {
                        "op": "/",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "-",
                            "args": [
                              "x",
                              0.5
                            ]
                          },
                          8
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "u",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 1.718281828459045,
              "tolerance": {
                "rel": 1e-09
              },
              "reduce": "L2_error",
              "reference": {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "exp",
                    "args": [
                      -1
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "cos",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "*",
                        "args": [
                          3.141592653589793,
                          {
                            "op": "/",
                            "args": [
                              {
                                "op": "-",
                                "args": [
                                  "x",
                                  0.5
                                ]
                              },
                              8
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "u",
              "time": 1.0,
              "expected": 64.360811,
              "tolerance": {
                "rel": 1e-06
              },
              "reduce": "Linf_error",
              "reference": {
                "op": "index",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "const",
